          <div class="log-submacros">Sat: ${(item.satFat || 0).toFixed(1)}g • Sug: ${(item.sugar || 0).toFixed(1)}g • Fib: ${(item.fiber || 0).toFixed(1)}g • Salt: ${(item.salt || 0).toFixed(2)}g</div>
